    <meta name="description" content="Reserve Bank of Malawi is the central bank of the Republic of Malawi. The mission of the Bank is to ensure price and financial stability through the formulation and implementation of sound monetary and macro-prudential Policies that are consistent with agreed national strategies. Its vision is to be an institution of excellence that promotes price and financial stability for economic development. " />
